# Normalize all text files to LF, regardless of platform or local git config
# (core.autocrlf) — Windows CI checkouts were converting committed LF files
# to CRLF, which made Biome's format check fail there but nowhere else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
